    "special": {
      "value": "You can't select another dedication feat until you have gained two other feats from the Nantambu Chime-Ringer archetype.\nLeads to: Deny the Songs of War|SoT2, Fleet Tempo|SoT2, Sing to the Steel|SoT2, Song of Grace And Speed|SoT2"
